column7:
The portal is promoted in several ways:
- it is referenced in the AgID official web sites;
- it is denoted as a tool for users and PAs in the Three-Year Plan for ICT in PA;
- it is denoted as single access point to Open Data in the Legislative Decree No. 36/2006 (amended by the Legislative Decree No. 200/2021 transposing Open Data Directive);
- in national, regional or local events with dedicated presentations, mentions or communication. An example is the Forum PA 2023, the most important national event dedicated to the topic of PA modernisation, where dedicated cards about the national portal were produced, published and distributed to the participants visiting the AgID stand (https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=620067630151604&set=t.100064451182098);
- by launching information campaign oh the web (e.g. https://www.facebook.com/photo/?fbid=767371235421242&set=pb.100064451182098.-2207520000)
